WEBVTT

fabrication
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Inspect a grown and deposited material structure, then compare dimensions with stated acceptance limits.

memory
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Trace a bit through its bank, die and stack. Prior bank state changes the next read.

architecture
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The matrix result stays exact while schedules, operand reuse and transfers change.

realization
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
An arithmetic contract becomes an inspectable netlist, routed resources and timing evidence.

hall
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Power and cooling admit the racks. Checkpoints determine which completed work survives a fault.

applications
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Inspect a classifier’s mistakes and a cited answer. Source support and task correctness are different tests.

orbital
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Energy, heat rejection and contact time constrain retained and delivered products.

progress
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Inspect attention, conditional compute and memory-bandwidth growth, then dated capacity evidence.
